  "description": "Renders Word, Excel and PowerPoint documents, with their legacy binary, OpenDocument and RTF relatives, to PDF and images (PNG, JPEG), and extracts their text, tables and structure. Pure C#, ported from LibreOffice; no office install, no native office process. This is the X-Ray.Office facade: it identifies a document by its content, dispatches to the right reader, and depends on every other X-Ray.Office package, so installing it brings the whole set.",
